add('c0025','culture-gfcf-technical-transition','Surface Detail (the GFCF)','Surface Detail',['book'],'The functioning advanced GFCF polity during the novel','Living pan-human GFCF residents','Technology rank and foreign-policy ambition are not welfare laws; Culture residents and subordinate external polities are separate.',
'''The GFCF is an advanced polity interacting with the Culture, but that identity does not supply a detailed ordinary material economy. The record therefore uses an explicit partial-transition best guess rather than another lore-gap omission. Its guarantee point assumes mixed conditional support with broad uncertainty. Technical rank, diplomatic ambition and a wealthy representative’s equipment are not treated as evidence of universal free necessities.

 Resident institutions and some distributed productive agency receive positive control weight, while concentrated leadership and stronger machine discretion remain in the interval. The GFCF is not assigned the Culture’s independent-Mind arrangement simply by technological proximity. The moderate nonworking scenario permits substantial substitution while counting research, administration, services, care and useful creation. No canonical participation percentage is claimed. The pan-human population proxy and wide bounds make the weak household evidence visible, and foreign-policy behavior is kept distinct from internal productive ownership. The point is one cautious institutional interpretation rather than a completed constitutional reconstruction.''',
(.15,.35,.5),([-.9,.98],[-.85,.95],[.03,.98]),('Advanced capability permits support, but ordinary coverage is highly uncertain.','Resident institutional agency is central with concentration and AI alternatives broad.','Substitution is plausible alongside useful research, care and services; no census exists in the checked reference.'),
['The GFCF is an advanced pan-human polity described in Surface Detail.'],['Ordinary material guarantees, ownership and participation are editorial estimates.','The Culture’s institutional model is not imported from technical proximity.'],'Retain the recognizable advanced polity with unusually broad explicit household uncertainty.',regime=4,zero=False,proxy=True)

