write_revision(31,changes,'Nine early literary holds retained with precise periods and explicit interpretations. Morthanveld AI restraint is corroborated, Gaia retains real useful work and Robot Visions has a conditional synthetic-person scope. Chemical apparent abundance and Daneel’s heterogeneous influence receive completed comparisons; the repeated Humanoid provider baseline links without duplication.')
